OL,3,GNEWSA'Our hearts will never be full
OL,4,Aagain,' family says
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Our hearts will never be full again,"
OL,7,Fa family has said, following the death
OL,8,Fof a 19-year-old man who they added
OL,9,Fwould "light up any room" he entered.
OL,11,FBradley Whieldon, from Abbey Hulton,
OL,12,FStoke-on-Trent, died at the scene of an
OL,13,Fincident on Brookhouse Road in Meir, at
OL,14,Faround 23:45 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FAnother man, in his late teens, who was
OL,17,Fseriously injured in the incident,
OL,18,Fremains in a stable condition in
OL,19,Fhospital, police said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
